// Twin of score 1 of input/regression/part-combine-mmrest-shared.ly.
// texidoc: "Multi-measure rests do not have to begin and end simultaneously to be combined."
//
// The two parts write THREE runs each and disagree about where they end:
//   part 1   8 | 16 | 4
//   part 2  16 |  8 | 4
// What LP engraves (measured, scratch/lpreg/pcmsh-a.log) is FOUR multi-measure rests —
// 8, 8, 8, 4 — one per segment between the boundaries EITHER part sets (0, 8, 16, 24).
// The 16-bar rest of part 1 is cut at bar 16, where the shared voice switches to part 2.
// LilyPond needs \compressMMRests for this; Lily# collapses a run of whole-bar rests on
// its own, so the twin says nothing about compression.
octave absolute
time 4/4

part vone { clef treble }
part vtwo { clef treble }

section A {
  vone { R1*8 | R1*16 | R1*4 | }
  vtwo { R1*16 | R1*8 | R1*4 | }
}

form main { ~A }

score main { combinedStaff { vone vtwo } }
